            "title": "<h2>How to Use <br/><em>Midnight Ritual Retinol</em></h2>",
            "subtitle": "",
            "content": "<p>In the evening, apply 1-2 pumps over clean, dry skin.<br/><br/>If you're new to retinol, start by using 1-2 alternate nights per week; increasing to every night as tolerated. Avoid using other actives on the same night. As skin cells turnover, you may experience purging. This is normal as the retinol begins to work and will subside over time. If you experience any irritation (i.e. burning or redness), please discontinue use.</p>"
