        "block_2_dEtQXW": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Midnight Ritual Retinol vegan and cruelty-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Summer Fridays products are not tested on animals or contain any animal by-products.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_wipdLf": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Midnight Ritual Retinol gluten-free?",
            "content": "<p>Midnight Ritual Retinol is formulated without gluten. It’s important to note that while all Summer Fridays products are formulated to be gluten-free, we cannot guarantee that they have been produced in a gluten-free facility. However, The National Celiac Association has stated that unless cosmetic products are ingested, there should not be an issue with gluten in topical products. </p><p>Please see <a href=\"https://nationalceliac.org/celiac-disease-questions/using-gluten-free-skin-body-products-someone-celiac-disease/\">here</a> for additional information. As always, if there is concern, we recommend that you consult with your physician/healthcare provider prior to use.<br/></p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_PFnEJE": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Midnight Ritual Retinol non-comedogenic?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Midnight Ritual Retinol is non-comedogenic, which means it will not clog pores.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_xY79XQ": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "disabled": true,
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Midnight Ritual Retinol suitable for all skin types?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Midnight Ritual Retinol is suitable for all skin types. If you have any concerns, we recommend that you ‘patch test’ prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_dnfwT7": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Midnight Ritual Retinol fragrance-free?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Midnight Ritual Retinol is formulated without fragrance.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_KBUJLC": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "How often should Midnight Ritual Retinol Renewal Serum be applied?",
            "content": "<p>Midnight Ritual Retinol should be used daily as part of your nighttime skincare routine.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_nrzmXH": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Can you pair this with BHA/AHA products?",
            "content": "<p>We recommend alternating days when using Midnight Ritual Retinol with BHA/AHA products. If you have sensitive skin, patch test Midnight Ritual Retinol and any BHA/AHA product behind the ear prior to use.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        },
        "block_2_tzWfpC": {
          "type": "block_2",
          "settings": {
            "title": "Is Midnight Ritual Retinol a good product for beginners?",
            "content": "<p>Yes, Midnight Ritual Retinol’s blend of oatmeal and tiger grass helps soothe and comfort the skin. It has also been formulated with two slow release retinoids that gently turn over skin cells. Midnight Ritual Retinol can be used daily as part of your nighttime skincare routine and is a great introductory product to someone new to retinols.</p>",
            "html": ""
          }
        }
      },
